  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Woodcutter.Demo.DemoSign
  title: "2. M\u1EA8U GI\u1EA4Y V\xC0 VI\xCAN \u0110\xC1 \u0110\u1ECE"
  body: "\u0110\u1EA7u game, \xF4ng ti\u1EC1u phu t\xECm th\u1EA5y m\u1ED9t <b>m\u1EA9u gi\u1EA5y ch\xE1y d\u1EDF</b> v\xE0 <b>\u0110\xE1 \u0110\u1ECF</b> trong m\u1ED9t ng\xE1ch nh\u1ECF.\n\u2022 \u0110\u1EE9ng g\u1EA7n, b\u1EA5m <b>E</b> \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc m\u1EA9u gi\u1EA5y \u2013 manh m\u1ED1i d\u1EABn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng.\n\u2022 B\u1EA5m <b>E</b> nh\u1EB7t \u0111\xE1: nh\u1EADn n\u0103ng l\u1EF1c <b>R\xECu l\u1EEDa</b>, +1 v\u1EA1ch m\xE1u, <b>m\xE0u \u0111\u1ECF loang ra</b> (t\xE1o, hoa) v\xE0 <b>l\u1EEDa tr\u1EA1i b\xF9ng ch\xE1y</b>."
  width: 470
  isCheckpoint: 1
